WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
It all started with robotics for me when my brother
got a LEGO robot as a gift from America.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.400
It seemed like an incredible tool
with incredible potential.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:11.880
But after a couple of weeks he put that LEGO robot
in a drawer and forgot about it.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.660
Then we realised that having
just equipment is not enough.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:19.040
It's not enough to just have robots
or virtual reality glasses.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:22.000
You need engaging, motivating
and useful content.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:24.840
You need a group, and you need goals:
reasons for why you're doing it.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:30.290
So with virtual reality we're training the brain
to prepare children and young teenagers

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:33.400
to be ready for the era
of artificial intelligence.
